(F5 T2 V4: element_interface_intpnt_gap_status (manual Professional 6.431):
 -closed when the accumulated normal strain <= gap, -opened otherwise.
 Element 1 (group 0, group_interface_gap -1e-4) opens by 1e-3: -opened
 -opened. Element 2 (group 1, default gap 0) is compressed by 1e-3:
 -closed -closed. The Professional 02-08-2026 does not write this record;
 its element_interface_intpnt_materi_tension_status gives the same
 statuses on this input (probe g2).)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 0 0
node 4 1 0
node 5 0 2
node 6 1 2
node 7 0 2
node 8 1 2
element 1 -quad4 1 2 3 4
element 2 -quad4 5 6 7 8
element_group 2 1
group_type 0 -materi
group_interface 0 -yes
group_interface_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
group_interface_materi_elasti_stiffness 0 1.e3 1.e3
group_interface_gap 0 -1.e-4
group_type 1 -materi
group_interface 1 -yes
group_interface_materi_memory 1 -total_linear
group_interface_materi_elasti_stiffness 1 1.e3 1.e3
bounda_dof 10 -ra 1 2 5 6 -ra -velx -vely
bounda_time 10 0.
bounda_dof 20 -ra 3 4 7 8 -ra -velx
bounda_time 20 0.
bounda_dof 21 -ra 3 4 -ra -vely
bounda_time 21 1.e-3
bounda_dof 22 -ra 7 8 -ra -vely
bounda_time 22 -1.e-3
control_timestep 10 0.1 1.0
end_data
